      "zh": "(4)根据上述(3)所述的方法，所述步骤(i)～(iv)分别独立地为以下步骤：",
      "en": "(4) The method according to (3) above, wherein said steps (i) to (iv) are each independently the following steps:",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "marker": "[0015]",
      "zh": "步骤(iii')中，溴代试剂为溴素、N-溴代丁二酰亚胺、或者溴化氢与双氧水的组合，优选为溴素；步骤(iv')中，CF3CH2OM为CF3CH2ONa或CF3CH2OK。",
      "en": "In step (iii'), the brominating reagent is bromine, N-bromosuccinimide, or a combination of hydrogen bromide and hydrogen peroxide, preferably bromine; in step (iv'), CF3CH2OM is CF3CH2ONa or CF3CH2OK.",
      "notes": "Subscripts in CF3CH2OM, CF3CH2ONa and CF3CH2OK are printed as typographic subscripts; transcribed here as plain digits. The hyphen in N-溴代丁二酰亚胺 is printed as a short dash."
    },
    {
      "marker": "[0016]",
      "zh": "(5)根据上述(1)至(4)中任意一项所述的方法，其包括如下所示的中间体制备步骤：",
      "en": "(5) The method according to any one of (1) to (4) above, comprising the intermediate preparation steps shown below:",
      "notes": null
    }
